# Every file in this repository is byte-exact on purpose: the checksums in
# REPRODUCE.md are of the stored bytes, and `generate` writes LF endings on
# every platform. Without this, a checkout with core.autocrlf=true (the
# Windows default) rewrites the FASTA and CSV files to CRLF, and every
# checksum in section 4 fails against a repository that is in fact correct.
* -text
